Package: chonkos-desktop-x11
Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Oliwier-w <oliwier-w@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: chonkos-core (= {{VERSION}}), i3-wm, dunst, xserver-xorg-core, xserver-xorg-input-libinput, libgl1-mesa-dri, xinit, xterm | x-terminal-emulator, rofi, xclip, scrot, brightnessctl, pipewire-audio, greetd, tuigreet, fonts-jetbrains-mono
Conflicts: chonkos-desktop
Description: ChonkOS X11 fallback desktop (i3 + Dunst) for legacy NVIDIA GPUs
 Flat Arctic i3 session with Dunst notifications and Rofi launcher for
 systems where the Wayland session cannot run (NVIDIA driver series 550
 and older), started by tuigreet via greetd.
